        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, sealing tape, aluminum/PE, 50 mm wide</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, sealing tape, aluminum/PE, 50 mm wide
Disposal of a tape made of Polyethylene, laminated with aluminium foil and acrylic glue as adherent layer. Weight 0.057 kg/m;
UUID: 4bb53fc8-84ca-4a01-94d4-f51fea2cb1cc
Transport to dismantling facilities, machines for handling in sorting plant, electricity demand for sorting plant, final disposal of waste material. Cut-off to recycling for metals.
Location: Specific to the technology mix encountered in sorting plants in Switzerland
Technology: Disposal to a sorting plant assumed. Metal pieces and copper in cables and electronic devices are recycled, plastic parts are incinerated, inert wastes (e.g. rock wool) are landfilled.
Time period: Amount of material investigated in 2003. Disposal technology mix as used in late 1990ies
Production volume: na
Sampling: Questionnaire and assumptions. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_4bb53fc8-84ca-4a01-94d4-f51fea2cb1cc.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
